{
    "title": "SuperLive- Live Stream & Chat",
    "description": "Welcome to SuperLive!\r\n\r\nSuperLive is a super popular video-streaming social network that allows you to show your skills, share your moments and -even more awesome- make incredible friends from all over the world!\r\n\r\nYou can broadcast LIVE and show your talents to all over the world. You can talk to your friends, get presents and have incredible fun on SuperLive. Share your special moments live with your friends all around the world and expand your community.  \r\n\r\nDo you have a beautiful voice? Sing! Do you like to dance while you are at home alone? Why not? In SuperLive, you can spend your time anyhow you like and have a wonderful time! \r\n\r\nIn SuperLive; you can follow your best streamers, send gifts and show your support! You can chat with your favorite streamers, follow their streams and never miss any of their special moments!\r\n\r\nIn SuperLive, it is super easy to go live and get followers at an instance! Just click on the stream button and start streaming! Build your community,  be a superstar and receive more gifts from your followers. \r\n\r\nIt is very easy to sign up for SuperLive. You can sign up via Facebook, Google or your mobile number. Don\u2019t want to sign up? That\u2019s fine! You can still watch the streams but we promise you do not want to miss being a member of this super community!\r\n\r\nDownload our free app today and discover streams, go live and make new friends!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to SuperLive!<br><br>SuperLive is a super popular video-streaming social network that allows you to show your skills, share your moments and -even more awesome- make incredible friends from all over the world!<br><br>You can broadcast LIVE and show your talents to all over the world. You can talk to your friends, get presents and have incredible fun on SuperLive. Share your special moments live with your friends all around the world and expand your community.  <br><br>Do you have a beautiful voice? Sing! Do you like to dance while you are at home alone? Why not? In SuperLive, you can spend your time anyhow you like and have a wonderful time! <br><br>In SuperLive; you can follow your best streamers, send gifts and show your support! You can chat with your favorite streamers, follow their streams and never miss any of their special moments!<br><br>In SuperLive, it is super easy to go live and get followers at an instance! Just click on the stream button and start streaming! Build your community,  be a superstar and receive more gifts from your followers. <br><br>It is very easy to sign up for SuperLive. You can sign up via Facebook, Google or your mobile number. Don\u2019t want to sign up? That\u2019s fine! You can still watch the streams but we promise you do not want to miss being a member of this super community!<br><br>Download our free app today and discover streams, go live and make new friends!",
